## L. 测试契约

每条 P0 Rule 必须有可独立执行的测试断言结构：

| Rule | 测试断言骨架 |
|---|---|
| VALUE.CONSISTENCY | 断言 `RuleResult.passed == True` when `round(system_val, gt.precision) == round(gt_val, gt.precision)` AND `system_unit == gt.unit` |
| TABLE.INTERNAL | 断言 `RuleResult.passed == True` when `compute_aggregate(kind, data) == system_aggregate` |
| LOGIC.CONSISTENCY | 断言 `RuleResult.passed == True` when `apply_rule(criterion.rule, fact.value, criterion.limit_value) == system_evaluation.status` |
| ANCHOR.BINDING | 断言每个 TokenOccurrence 要么命中 whitelist 要么有正确 anchor |
| CONCLUSION.DIRECTION | 断言 `system_direction == gt.direction` |
| CONCLUSION.COVERAGE | 断言 `gt.required_ids ⊆ system.covers_union` |
| EXPECTED.HIT | 断言每个去重后的 ExpectedIssue 被一条 SystemReportedIssue 命中 |

前置条件测试：断言 `case.validate() == []` 后才进入 P0 规则执行；否则 `ValidationResult.precondition_error != None`。

